About The Job Cybersecurity And Infrastructure Specialist

We are recruiting a Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Specialist to strengthen our team, with the possibility of working in a hybrid model.

What We Are Looking For


 * Bachelors or Masters degree in Computer Science or Telecommunications Engineering or related field;
 * 6 years (minimum) of experience with Perimeter security with Palo Alto next-generation firewalls and IPv6 protocol;
 * Experience with VPN-SSL (Pulse Secure/Juniper SA);
 * Certifications: F5 Networks: Application Delivery Fundamentals 101; Palo Alto Networks: Palo Alto Networks Certified Network Security Associate (PCNSA) and/or Palo Alto Networks Certified Network Security Engineer (PCNSE); Checkpoint (CCSA and CCSE);
 * English B2 level;
 * Availability for on-call support (1 week per month, evenings/weekends).



What We Have To Offer


 * Flexibility in the work regime (hybrid);
 * Opportunity for professional growth in a growing company;
 * Collaborative and supportive work environment;
 * Competitive benefits package.



If you identify with this profile, send us your updated CV to recrutamento@movilges.com

If You Want To Learn More About Us

Movilges IT Consulting has over 30 years of experience in the Spanish market, specializing in Logistics, Mobility, and IT. We offer consulting services, application development, and system maintenance. Just as the technological universe is constantly evolving, Movilges IT Consulting aims to evolve as well, increasing its presence in Portugal. We strive not only to provide the best services to partners and clients but also to offer the best conditions, benefits, and professional growth opportunities for our entire team.

